{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n香港各地都有不少高質素的人氣梳乎厘班戟（Soufflé Pancake）專門店及咖啡廳。新假期精選全港 8 間極具代表性的梳乎厘班戟店推介，涵蓋過江龍名店、法國藍帶主理小店、工廈巨型班戟以至平民小店之選，甜品控一定要收藏！\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wwig_sakura_new-_13761395326afd2122f1bda-1024x1280.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"梳乎厘班戟 （圖片來源：新假期編輯部）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wwig_sakura_new-_13761395326afd2122f1bda-1024x1280.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：新假期編輯部）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wwig_sakura_new-1_10867290386afd211d9665f-1024x1280.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"梳乎厘班戟 （圖片來源：新假期編輯部）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wwig_sakura_new-1_10867290386afd211d9665f-1024x1280.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：新假期編輯部）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>1.PAN de PAIN Pancake &amp; Sweets</h2>\n<p>PAN de PAIN Pancake &amp; Sweets 是全港首間日式班戟專門店，自2016年開業以嚟一直人氣高企！店家主打即叫即製日式梳乎厘班戟，嚴選日本麵粉和3.6牛乳製作，每份梳乎厘班戟上枱時都會「震騰騰」，切開口感鬆軟綿密，充滿濃郁蛋香同奶香。口味推薦No.1皇牌宇治抹茶梳乎厘，嚴選優質宇治抹茶，特意調配出帶有微甘茶香而不苦澀的完美比例。一碟集結多重口感：熱騰騰的軟滑梳乎厘、冰凍濃郁的抹茶雪糕、香濃幼滑的抹茶忌廉，以及帶有咬口的香甜日本紅豆，冷熱交融，層次極豐富。除咗主推嘅抹茶口味，品牌亦提供多款招牌口味例如原味、士多啤梨等，亦會定期推出期間限定口味，好似近期大受歡迎嘅荔枝玫瑰燕窩梳乎厘班戟，賣相夢幻，影相打卡一流！</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dsc01300_13934642356afc1f231383d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1439\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dsc01300_13934642356afc1f231383d-1024x1535.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/872423107_18578596156072288_1305653355973344917_n_532980796afc20a86b74b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1271\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/872423107_18578596156072288_1305653355973344917_n_532980796afc20a86b74b-1024x1356.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/480191143_8466331066799960_929585563600092324_n_9462458536afc1fc7eae13.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/480191143_8466331066799960_929585563600092324_n_9462458536afc1fc7eae13-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/59616320_1810010942432039_1403490790008684544_n_2222648686afc1fc5b72d8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1439\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/59616320_1810010942432039_1403490790008684544_n_2222648686afc1fc5b72d8-1024x1535.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>PAN de PAIN Pancake &amp; Sweets</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍尖沙咀河內道18號K11購物藝術館B1樓B111B及B111C號舖</p>\n<p>📍銅鑼灣勿地臣街1號時代廣場B2樓B215號舖</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pandepain/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方FB</a>｜<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/pandepain/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>2.Four O Five Coffee &amp; Eatery</h2>\n<p>位於觀塘成業街工廈的 Four O Five Coffee &amp; Eatery，其招牌梳乎厘班戟最大特色在於即叫即製的巨型厚身造型，端上枱時呈現「動L」的空氣感，口感鬆軟綿密且蛋香濃郁。熱門口味有焦糖吉士、伯爵茶珍珠、泰式奶茶及特濃開心果，瀑布流心忌廉好澎湃，仲有煙韌麻糬增添嚼勁！</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cafe_7___15217937066afd1fc67c5f3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cafe_7___15217937066afd1fc67c5f3-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：小紅書）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/pancake_1___15783063026afd1fc7f0852.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/pancake_1___15783063026afd1fc7f0852-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：小紅書）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Four O Five Coffee &amp; Eatery</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍觀塘成業街19-21號成業工業大廈地下2號舖</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/four0five_coffee/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>3.J.S. FOODIES</h2>\n<p>被譽為「奇跡之梳乎厘班戟 」的日本梳乎厘班戟店FLIPPER’S的姊妹品牌，主打極致空氣感與入口即化的梳乎厘班戟，蛋香濃郁且無需用刀，用兩支叉子就可以輕輕撕開。招牌原味梳乎厘配上自家製楓糖牛油忌廉，最能突出純粹蛋香，而鮮果款式則鋪滿新鮮士多啤梨、藍莓與香蕉，酸甜清新，輕盈不膩。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2022-11-10-6.30.51_1805955443636cd337caf53_3659256986afd1fea70c85.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"459\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2022-11-10-6.30.51_1805955443636cd337caf53_3659256986afd1fea70c85.jpg\" width=\"688\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/pancake_5068492446afd1feb36c42.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/pancake_5068492446afd1feb36c42.jpg\" width=\"750\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>J.S. FOODIES</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍銅鑼灣軒尼詩道500號希慎廣場6樓i.t blue block</p>\n<p>📍尖沙咀廣東道3-27號海港城港威商場2樓2608-2609號舖</p>\n<p>📍九龍塘達之路80號又一城LG2樓LG2-30號舖i.t blue block</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/j.s.foodieshk/?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>4.Black Coffee</h2>\n<p>由人氣甜品店 HeySoNuts 班底主理的型格咖啡店 Black Coffee，其梳乎厘班戟即叫即製且極具空氣感，厚度十足且軟熟綿密，充滿蛋香又不會過於甜膩。必食招牌黑芝麻醬梳乎厘班戟，芝麻味非常濃郁；70%髒髒朱古力梳乎厘班戟撒滿厚厚可可粉，味道甘香醇厚帶微苦，朱古力控必試！</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dsc06651_16440695136afd2006a3e7d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1440\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dsc06651_16440695136afd2006a3e7d-1024x1536.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/c014602_2233347016afd20040c456.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/c014602_2233347016afd20040c456-1024x1532.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Black Coffee</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍旺角廣華街3號地下3號舖</p>\n<p>📍觀塘協和街33號裕民坊YM² 2樓201號舖</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/blackcoffeehk/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>5.南山梳乎厘</h2>\n<p>由深水埗南山邨起家的本地人氣甜品店 南山梳乎厘，主打平民親民價錢、足料厚身空氣感梳乎厘班戟。提供超過10款創意鹹甜口味，售價約由 $50 起。必試招牌海鹽芝士梳乎厘，淋上質感如奶蓋般幼滑的自家製海鹽芝士醬，面層鋪滿香脆鹹蛋黃餅乾碎；仲有士多啤梨、開心果、D24 榴槤等人氣口味。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/souffle-namshan-03_12721708566afd202f9f66f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/souffle-namshan-03_12721708566afd202f9f66f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/souffle-namshan-01_466031596afd2030e0d33.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/souffle-namshan-01_466031596afd2030e0d33.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>南山梳乎厘</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍深水埗元州街1F號地舖</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/souffle_namshan/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>6.TERA 寺</h2>\n<p>人氣日系咖啡店 TERA 寺由法國藍帶廚師主理，其招牌梳乎厘班戟嚴選日本雞蛋與日本牛奶製作，搭配法國麵粉及牛油，散發濃郁蛋香和牛油香，三層高班戟極度蓬鬆軟綿，入口即化。人氣招牌口味有金箔 Nutella、開心果杜拜朱古力、宇治抹茶等；鹹味款式大推金卵煙肉梳乎厘班戟。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_582034280_18061603958631470_2822276693717722434_n_4595205866afd20514825f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_582034280_18061603958631470_2822276693717722434_n_4595205866afd20514825f-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_622391513_18069683264631470_2963994828004338698_n_14205777946afd205444140.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_622391513_18069683264631470_2963994828004338698_n_14205777946afd205444140-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>TERA</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍大圍車公廟路18號圍方3樓320號舖</p>\n<p>📍元朗元龍街9號形點 I L1樓1075號舖</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/tera_pancake/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>7.The Pantry</h2>\n<p>本地人氣咖啡店 The Pantry的招牌梳乎厘班戟很受甜品控愛戴，最大特色在於粉漿加入了意大利 Ricotta 芝士製作，令梳乎厘擁有如日式芝士蛋糕般細膩濕潤的口感與淡淡奶香，外層煎至微金黃且相對挺身不易塌陷。招牌人氣口味有焦糖燉蛋香蕉拖肥、Tiramisu、杜拜朱古力、焙茶麻糬柑橘等。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/479496949_1089154003224155_7103619131504934036_n_15572042716afd208baf441-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"梳乎厘班戟 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/479496949_1089154003224155_7103619131504934036_n_15572042716afd208baf441-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The Pantry</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍旺角太子道西193號MOKO新世紀廣場4樓436-438號舖</p>\n<p>📍九龍城啟德承啟道38-39號啟德體育園啟德零售館3 G樓M3-005號舖</p>\n<p>📍葵芳興芳路223號新都會廣場5樓531-540號舖</p>\n<p>📍馬鞍山海映路9號西沙GO PARK地下G11號舖</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/thepantryclub_hk/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>8.PHI Coffee &amp; Pancake</h2>\n<p>本地人氣連鎖咖啡店 PHI Coffee &amp; Pancake 其招牌日式梳乎厘班戟嚴選日本雞蛋搭配韓國低筋麵粉，令班戟散發濃郁天然蛋香，同時保持質地細膩軟綿且厚身飽滿。除了經典原味外，伯爵茶、宇治抹茶、士多啤梨慕絲及藍莓希臘乳酪等都是人氣款式，每款都配搭瀑布忌廉醬，香甜細膩。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/486467064_1121651393305865_5305756053788612046_n_16081244376afd20a0995e0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/486467064_1121651393305865_5305756053788612046_n_16081244376afd20a0995e0-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/468461107_17942952869919874_9010341325790997837_n_1108686646afd209dc2487.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/468461107_17942952869919874_9010341325790997837_n_1108686646afd209dc2487-1024x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>PHI Coffee &amp; Pancake</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.fulum.com.hk/concept-dining/402.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">門市地址詳情</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/phi.coffee.pancake/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a>\n</p>\n<p>香港18區美食有甚麼推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>新假期編輯已經為你整合了香港18區美食指，其中包括尖沙咀、旺角、銅鑼灣等<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">……即睇更多詳情。</a></b><br/>\n</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T04:45:38.183821+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2596,"images":19,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T03:56:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T04:39:06.950498+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T04:39:06.950498+00:00","content_hash":"4dfdc20116904ccd13a46d1f93e8f9ae5e77861b8fc81213c1a5cf33eec81a97","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}